  "scope": "Fixed8360-slot actual caller begins with only represented capacity, vertex-label, adjacency-matrix and demand lists. Four executed allocations build all composite context metadata; that same allocated input feeds the complete parameter, initialization and iteration machine. It returns every literal old solveInput state/event field and pays the terminal-inclusive physical charge under an original-input-only bound. Initial primitive list representations, positive graph order, numeric labels and demand encoding remain explicit. Construction of those primitive lists from raw graph data, outer degenerate dispatch and full-paper runtime remain separate."
